# Everything here is rebuildable from the code beside it, and it is 1.4 GB.
#
#   data/bars/     925 MB   -- python fetch_bars.py
#   data/stage0.db 495 MB   -- python study.py, then features.py
#   data/raw/        5 MB   -- the Wikipedia pages universe*.py download
#
# What IS committed: data/universe/ (440 KB). Those files are the point-in-time
# index membership and the sector map -- small, and the one thing that would be
# awkward to reproduce exactly, because Wikipedia's pages change under us.
data/bars/
data/raw/
data/stage0.db
data/stage0.db-wal
data/stage0.db-shm
data/stage0.db-journal

# Run logs
_*.log
__pycache__/
